      "message": "Note that `ComputeEstimatedMemoryUsageInfo`\u0027s name indicates its purpose is for estimating the memory usage.\n\nFor vulkan\u0027s memory usage, I think we could add a function to:\n[1] https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/include/dawn/native/VulkanBackend.h ?",
