      "writtenOn": "2025-03-20T15:08:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`totalUsage` doesn\u0027t need to be strictly `buffersUsage` + `texturesUsage`. In future it would count hidden memory such as shaders, internal buffers, etc.\n\nSo if you want to unify the function, I think for vulkan, just returning `vulkanAllocatedMemory` as `totalUsage` would also ok.",
